{"id":"n17304-1-9","stage":1,"title":"개월 · 个月","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17304-1-9-1","ko":"너 육 개월 후에 유학 간다면서?","zh":"你不是说六个月后就要去留学吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"육","meaning":"六","explanation":"육：六","readings":[{"term":"육","audio":"/audio/432a18159c59981fc3bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70820","senseId":"1","lemma":"육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개월","meaning":"个月","explanation":"개월：个月","readings":[{"term":"개월","audio":"/audio/596e482d3557733c80a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17304","senseId":"1","lemma":"개월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후에","meaning":"后，以后，之后","explanation":"후：后，以后，之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"432a18159c59981f","term":"육","zh":"六","audio":"/audio/432a18159c59981fc3bc.mp3","entryId":"70820","definition":"五加一所得的数目。","pronunciation":["육"]},{"id":"596e482d3557733c","term":"개월","zh":"个月","audio":"/audio/596e482d3557733c80a4.mp3"