3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"5","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"一半，半","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57623","definition":"平均分成两个后的其中一个。","pronunciation":["반ː"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"9ce364fc9c6f2a1c","term":"준비","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3","entryId":"86434","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비"]},{"id":"686f8e089bf22cd0","term":"끝내다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3","entryId":"29692","definition":"做完事情。","pronunciation":["끈내다"]},{"id":"9ee56e8783da00e3","term":"떠나다","zh":"上路，动身","audio":"/audio/